```console
$ scherzo-cloud auth identities remove --help
Remove a linked sign-in identity

Usage: scherzo-cloud auth identities remove [OPTIONS] <IDENTITY_ID>

Arguments:
  <IDENTITY_ID>  Exact linked identity ID

Options:
      --json                 Print the identity result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
